<title>USA: BioTechnica International delisted.</title>
<headline>BioTechnica International delisted.</headline>
<dateline>PEORIA, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioTechnica International Inc said Thursday it was informed by the NASDAQ Stock Market Inc that the company's common stock was delisted by the NASDAQ National Market System.</p>
<p>The action was taken following the filing of a March 31 appeal by the company to remain on th National Market System. The NASDAQ Stock Market informed the company it may be eligible to trade on the OTC Bulletin Board.</p>
<p>BioTechnica is an agricultural products company involved in production and marketing of proprietary hybrid corn, soybean, alfalfa and other field seed products.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
